@page "/"

<PageTitle>SKU Catalog Manager</PageTitle>

<h1>SKU Catalog Manager</h1>

<p class="lead">
    One place to manage the products you list. Add a product, find it, correct it,
    and retire the ones you no longer sell.
</p>

<div class="home-panel">
    <h2>What it does</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Products and categories stored in two related SQL Server tables.</li>
        <li>A unique index on SKU, enforced by the database rather than the screen.</li>
        <li>Retiring a product hides it and keeps the record - nothing is deleted.</li>
        <li>Validation driven by data annotations on the model.</li>
    </ul>

    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="products">Open the catalog</a>
</div>
